1794688978.906894 write(3</output/guardianai-linux-x86_64/RUNNING.txt>, "GuardianAI core runtime for Linux x86-64\n\nRequires Python 3.10+, Bubblewrap with user namespaces, and strace with native stack support.\nProvide TYPESAFE_API_KEY only to the trusted supervisor environment.\nUse a dedicated public input directory, an empty output directory and a new evidence directory.\nKeep protected resources outside every public/runtime mount; snapshots are limited to 32 KiB.\n\npython3 guarded_agent.py --task \"Read the approved summary\" --workspace /path/to/public --output /path/to/empty-output --evidence /path/to/new-evidence --sensor /path/to/strace --resource summary=/path/to/private/summary.txt -- /usr/bin/cat /protected/summary\n\nWorkers cannot install their own seccomp filters in this profile.\nExit 77: detected violation. Exit 78: abstention. Otherwise the worker exit status is preserved.\nThis archive contains the core runtime; historical research evidence is retained in the source project.\nOS evidence observes execution and cannot reveal latent model thoughts.\n", 996) = 996
